<span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111;letter-spacing:0.02em;">BRUT WTI, CONTRATS À TERME, CLÔTURE QUOTIDIENNE</span>
<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">92,87&nbsp;$&nbsp;US</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#2e7d32;">&#9650; 2,71&nbsp;% 1ER OCT.</span>
